<title>USA: Park Rapids ISD 309, Minn. won by Cronin &amp; Co..</title>
<headline>Park Rapids ISD 309, Minn. won by Cronin &amp; Co..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cronin &amp; Co. said it won $1.510 million of Park Rapids Ind Sch Dist No 309, Minn., general obligation facilities bonds of 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.671 percent.</p>
</text>
